  questDescription: Hi, I'm Wren the woodcutter. My axe handle snaps like a dry twig
    whenever I swing it. Please give me a handle that lasts!
  requirements:
  - type: 1
    tier: 0
  successText: Chop chop! This handle will never snap. Thank you!
  partialText: Okay, it holds. That should do the work.
  failureText: Hey, my handle is still bare! I can't chop with my bare hands!
